{
  "id": "whatsapp",
  "slot": "agent-channels",
  "description": "WhatsApp Cloud API channel adapter — Meta's official Graph API path (NOT Twilio). Provides receive() over webhook with HMAC-SHA256 signature verification (X-Hub-Signature-256 + WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET) and send() via POST to graph.facebook.com/v18.0/<PHONE_NUMBER_ID>/messages with bearer auth. Includes the GET-challenge handshake required by Meta to subscribe a webhook.",
